  Cash prizes: PLN 10\,000 (~EUR 2\,340) first place\, PLN 6\,000 second\, 
 PLN 3\,000 third\; the jury may award additional honorary distinctions or 
 redistribute the pool. Free to enter\, submission is exclusively digital.\
